unity from a little charm casted  by dumbledore we were not told the exact  situation unfortunately we guess the law  was worked around with a little magic  news case is multiplied yeah  it's basically saying there are a few  cases number seven all beloved  franchises keep their stories secret  before their release but what does the  cast know we think they'd have to know  something right do you hear that this  time you might be going to um so lots of  sort of rumors would find themselves as  far as filmmakers allowed the actors to  go was a script-by-script basis the  actors had no clue what their  character's ultimate endings would be  but they did get small hints as to what  would happen in the next film  occasionally we would get snippets of  what might be coming up in the next  films  number eight fans may be a little  weirded out to see a new dumbledore and  this time he's going to be a very  underdeveloped character he's not the  fully formed dumbledore of the harry  potter books and films law's  interpretation of the character is  supposed to be a take on before he  obtained the wisdom we know from the  classical interpretations of richard  harris and michael gambin albus is  getting his affairs in order on this one  and who better to join the dumbledore  legacy than jude law he's a man still  finding his way still resolving his  demons  number nine as johnny depp's abrupt  departure from the beast franchise  caused a lot of uncertainty someone had  to step in as his replacement luckily  mads mikkelsen was able to quickly fill  the shoes and he was rushed to do it my  journey was fast the swift but i felt at  home right away but he fit right in with  the cast and jumping in with good  chemistry is no easy task although his  time was short mads really made a small  family out of the cast it's a family you  visit and you just can only hope that  they will adopt you number 10 a trilogy  requires new members of the cast and  along with mads came the great jessic